Art. 4.—It takes a quick man three years to @@R1@@
>>>
<<<
@@R1@@
===
learn how to tune a piano well in equal temperament by estimation of ear, as I learn from Mr. A. J. Hipkins. Tuners have not time for any other method. The following are good examples:—

