are only five intervals absolutely correct, two others are only an inappreciable 1 cent in error, two are a just appreciable 2 cents wrong, two are 3 cents out, and one wrong by the very perceptible interval of 4 cents. Now if this is the work of a clever tuner in @@R1@@
